{
  "_comment": [
    "Stalwart v0.16 on-disk configuration. As of v0.16 this file describes ONLY",
    "the datastore; domains, accounts, DKIM keys, relay policy and rate limits",
    "live inside that datastore and are managed through the server's own",
    "management interface (see infra/mail/README.md).",
    "",
    "This is a TEMPLATE. On first start Stalwart runs in bootstrap mode when no",
    "config.json exists and writes its own; adopt that file rather than pasting",
    "this one blindly, then keep it under configuration management."
  ],
  "store": {
    "db": {
      "type": "rocksdb",
      "path": "/var/lib/stalwart/data"
    }
  }
}
